  "wikitext": "Each Discord server is its own region with its own production modifiers which affect how fast your [[:Category:Asset|asset]] gathering [[:Category:Facility|facilities]] work. These production modifiers are different in each region and will change every 48 hours. Each region also has unique prices for assets.\n== Modifiers (Facilities) ==\nThere are regional modifiers for the following facilities:\n\n=== Soil Health ===\n* [[tree farm]]\n* [[cotton farm]]\n\n=== Oil concentration ===\n* [[oil well]]\n\n=== Solar Irradiance ===\n* [[solar power plant]]\n\n=== Minerals ===\n* [[coal mine]]\n* [[iron mine]]\n* [[silicon mine]]\n* [[gold mine]]\n* [[bauxite mine]]\n\n=== Industry ===\n* [[laptop factory]]\n* [[coal power plant]]\n* [[gasoline engine factory]]\n* [[car factory]]\n* [[television factory]]\n* [[digital camera factory]]\n* [[prescription drug factory]]\n* [[truck factory]]\n\n== Modifiers (Other) ==\n=== Happiness ===\nHappiness affects all facility productions, not only the facilities that produce assets\n\n=== [[:Category:Asset|Asset]] prices ===\nThe asset prices update every day (not sure), they are unique and different in every region\n\n=== Policies ===\nSome [[:Category:Policy|policies]] are regional modifiers that affect facilities and assets",
