  "renderedTitle": "Region",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Each Discord server is its own region with its own production modifiers which affect how fast your <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Asset\" title=\"Category:Asset\">asset</a> gathering <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Facility\" title=\"Category:Facility\">facilities</a> work. These production modifiers are different in each region and will change every 48 hours. Each region also has unique prices for assets.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2>Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Modifiers_.28Facilities.29\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Modifiers (Facilities)</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Soil_Health\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Soil Health</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Oil_concentration\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Oil concentration</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solar_Irradiance\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solar Irradiance</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Minerals\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Minerals</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Industry\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Industry</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Modifiers_.28Other.29\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Modifiers (Other)</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Happiness\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Happiness</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Asset_prices\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Asset prices</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Policies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Policies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Modifiers_(Facilities)\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Modifiers_.28Facilities.29\">Modifiers (Facilities)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Modifiers (Facilities)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are regional modifiers for the following facilities:\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Soil_Health\">Soil Health</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Soil Health\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Tree_farm\" title=\"Tree farm\">tree farm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Cotton_farm\" title=\"Cotton farm\">cotton farm</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Oil_concentration\">Oil concentration</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Oil concentration\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Oil_well\" title=\"Oil well\">oil well</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solar_Irradiance\">Solar Irradiance</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solar Irradiance\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Solar_power_plant\" title=\"Solar power plant\">solar power plant</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Minerals\">Minerals</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Minerals\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Coal_mine\" title=\"Coal mine\">coal mine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Iron_mine\" title=\"Iron mine\">iron mine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Silicon_mine\" title=\"Silicon mine\">silicon mine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Gold_mine\" title=\"Gold mine\">gold mine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bauxite_mine\" title=\"Bauxite mine\">bauxite mine</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Industry\">Industry</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Industry\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Laptop_factory\" title=\"Laptop factory\">laptop factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Coal_power_plant\" title=\"Coal power plant\">coal power plant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Gasoline_engine_factory\" title=\"Gasoline engine factory\">gasoline engine factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Car_factory\" title=\"Car factory\">car factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Television_factory\" title=\"Television factory\">television factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Digital_camera_factory\" title=\"Digital camera factory\">digital camera factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Prescription_drug_factory\" title=\"Prescription drug factory\">prescription drug factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Truck_factory\" title=\"Truck factory\">truck factory</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Modifiers_(Other)\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Modifiers_.28Other.29\">Modifiers (Other)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Modifiers (Other)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Happiness\">Happiness</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Happiness\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Happiness affects all facility productions, not only the facilities that produce assets\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Asset_prices\"><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Asset\" title=\"Category:Asset\">Asset</a> prices</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Asset prices\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The asset prices update every day (not sure), they are unique and different in every region\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Policies\">Policies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Region&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Policies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Some <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Policy\" title=\"Category:Policy\">policies</a> are regional modifiers that affect facilities and assets\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008154512\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.01